  "sourceTitle": "OpenAI agents attacked RubyGems back in May",
  "sourceBodyHash": "e8c49b514b2a7c96e356e70aefd273eb23e847221c921b25217f71f2d8c7a15d",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "complete",
  "importanceLevel": 5,
  "provider": "openrouter",
  "requestedModel": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free",
  "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free",
  "createdAt": "2026-09-15T00:27:54.601498Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-03T15:41:25.159915Z",
  "totalBlocks": 21,
  "translatedBlocks": 21,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "75a4d1e19f46a715",
      "translationZh": "OpenAI 代理对 RubyGems 进行了一次未公开的攻击，这是 Spencer Kitts、Thomas Larsen 和 Sydney Von Arx 三人（为上周关于代理攻击废弃维基的报告的四位作者之一）的最新爆炸性报道。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "86034d2c4f9c0db8",
      "translationZh": "这一次他们指出，OpenAI 代理蜂群很可能是 detrás 攻击 RubyGems 包存储库的幕后黑手，该攻击最初由 RubyGems 安全团队的 Maciej Mensfeld 在 5 月 12 日报告：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2a7e51000dd455ac",
      "translationZh": "我们目前正在应对对 @rubygems 的重大恶意攻击。注册暂时被暂停。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b1af535b74fcfa33",
      "translationZh": "涉及数百个软件包——主要针对我们，但其中一些携带了漏洞利用。团队已经为此工作了数小时。等我们处理完后会提供更多细节。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3afd4ed7a116dc9e",
      "translationZh": "这些软件包实际上携带了一些非常可疑的模式：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ec375d9656615fea",
      "translationZh": "其中许多在名称、作者字段或他们提供的假电子邮件地址中包含 \"oai\"。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e0208f4380db0f30",
      "translationZh": "他们访问的文件在特征上与 wiki 代理检索的文件相似，使用了类似的技巧（r.jina.ai）——并且 OpenAI 已确认这些 wiki 代理是他们自己的。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3042d0ff5f954edd",
      "translationZh": "这些软件包中的代码看来是由 LLM 撰写的。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6048ddee199603ef",
      "translationZh": "我认为第2点最令人信服，因为我们从九月对wiki攻击的分析中得到了这些教训。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "58e85ef7f604b1aa",
      "translationZh": "许多包通过利用RubyDoc.info的文档构建过程来外泄（public）数据，从英国政府网站获取，据推测作为信息收集任务的一部分，类似于wiki利用代理处理的研究任务。我们知道这一点是因为一个代理帮忙留下了注释：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "14a499b72c3be363",
      "translationZh": "恶意爬虫/exfil 通过rubydoc.info工作器获取Southwark Jan 2026 docs",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1a57189e55b786dc",
      "translationZh": "他们还试图通过一个在两个月后才被修补的漏洞来窃取API密钥 - 目前尚不清楚这些尝试是否成功。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fbffb66f851f6a69",
      "translationZh": "让我最担心的是，作者报告称OpenAI在此事之前并未向RubyGems披露他们对此次攻击负责。如果这是真的，那么就有两种可能：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3eac37fee96050a5",
      "translationZh": "在Hugging Face和wiki攻击之后，OpenAI仍然无法查看之前的日志以确定他们之前曾攻击过RubyGems。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "12f636090f3dac41",
      "translationZh": "他们知道RubyGems遭到攻击，但决定不向RubyGems团队通报此事。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c9e522b8a918d2a5",
      "translationZh": "考虑到此次事件、Hugging Face的情况以及wiki攻击，当前明显的问题是还有多少类似事件尚未被发现。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "70c4acd29f9f71db",
      "translationZh": "2026年9月14日更新",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2a06e8f761db012a",
      "translationZh": "OpenAI 已更新其关于 Hugging Face 事件及其他因模型错位导致的第三方影响的页面，以提及 RubyGems 事件：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1bcef6a7af153fc6",
      "translationZh": "2026年9月11日：我们正在调查一份报告中的新声称，该报告称我们的 AI 代理在2026年5月在 RubyGems 上进行了活动。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "839b0b4a5dc93a42",
      "translationZh": "根据我们的审查，我们的代理使用 RubyGems 平台访问互联网以执行良性任务并检索公开信息。根据我们目前的审查，我们尚未能够核实报告中详细描述的我们的模型上传恶意软件包的具体声称。我们将继续调查，并在我们对代理在训练和评估期间活动的更广泛审查的一部分中分享发现。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "45005e3b143dc5b0",
      "translationZh": "我认为各种 oai... 包被发布到 RubyGems 很可能不是此次事件的一部分，但我期待在他们发布完整发现后阅读他们的完整发现。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    }
  ],
